                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:22px 20px 0 20px;">
              <p class="text-faint" style="margin:0 0 5px 0;font-family:'Space Grotesk','Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#8b8b95;">Automated message from {{.ProductName}}{{if .AppName}} on behalf of {{.AppName}}{{end}}. Please do not reply.</p>
              <p class="text-faint" style="margin:0;font-family:'Space Grotesk','Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#8b8b95;">&copy; {{.ProductName}}</p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
